{
  "info": {
    "_postman_id": "walvy-modulo1-auth-onboarding-v1",
    "name": "Walvy — API (Módulo 1 + Suscripciones)",
    "description": "Colección completa: registro, verificación de email, sesión, contraseña, onboarding, perfil y suscripciones.\n\n**Uso del Happy Path:**\n1. Ajusta las variables `email`, `password` y `documentNumber`.\n2. Ejecuta la carpeta '🚀 Happy Path' con Collection Runner.\n3. Después del paso 01 (Registro), revisa tu correo, copia el código OTP y pégalo en la variable `otpCode`.\n4. Continúa desde el paso 02 — el resto encadena automáticamente.\n\n**Chaining:** los pasos 02 al 08 usan `setNextRequest` para avanzar solos en Collection Runner.",
    "schema": "https://schema.getpostman.com/json/collection/v2.1.0/collection.json"
  },
  "variable": [
    { "key": "baseUrl",        "value": "http://localhost:3000", "type": "string" },
    { "key": "email",          "value": "test.walvy@mailinator.com", "type": "string" },
    { "key": "password",       "value": "Test123456!", "type": "string" },
    { "key": "documentNumber", "value": "12345678-9",  "type": "string" },
    { "key": "accessToken",    "value": "", "type": "string" },
    { "key": "refreshToken",   "value": "", "type": "string" },
    { "key": "userId",         "value": "", "type": "string" },
    { "key": "otpCode",        "value": "", "type": "string", "description": "Llenar manualmente con el OTP recibido por email (6 dígitos)" },
    { "key": "resetOtpCode",   "value": "", "type": "string", "description": "Código OTP de 6 dígitos recibido por email para recuperar contraseña" },
    { "key": "planId",         "value": "", "type": "string", "description": "ID del plan obtenido de GET /subscriptions/plans (pro_monthly o pro_annual)" }
  ],
  "item": [

    {
      "name": "🚀 Happy Path — Registro al Onboarding",
      "description": "Flujo completo en orden. Usar Collection Runner. Pausar después del paso 01 para ingresar el código OTP en la variable `otpCode`.",
      "item": [

        {
          "name": "01 · Registro",
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [{ "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" }],
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"email\": \"{{email}}\",\n  \"documentNumber\": \"{{documentNumber}}\",\n  \"password\": \"{{password}}\",\n  \"acceptTerms\": true,\n  \"acceptPrivacy\": true\n}",
              "options": { "raw": { "language": "json" } }
            },
            "url": { "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/auth/register", "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"], "path": ["auth", "register"] },
            "description": "Crea la cuenta. El backend envía el OTP por email automáticamente.\n\n⚠️ Después de ejecutar este paso: revisa el correo, copia el código OTP y pégalo en la variable `otpCode` antes de continuar con el paso 02."
          },
          "event": [{
            "listen": "test",
            "script": {
              "exec": [
                "if ([200, 201].includes(pm.response.code)) {",
                "    const res = pm.response.json();",
                "    pm.collectionVariables.set('accessToken', res.accessToken);",
                "    pm.collectionVariables.set('refreshToken', res.refreshToken);",
                "    pm.collectionVariables.set('userId', res.user.id);",
                "    pm.collectionVariables.set('email', res.user.email);",
                "    console.log('✅ Registro OK — userId: ' + res.user.id);",
                "    console.log('📧 Revisa tu correo y guarda el OTP en la variable otpCode');",
                "    pm.test('Registro exitoso', () => pm.response.to.have.status(201));",
                "    pm.test('accessToken presente', () => pm.expect(res.accessToken).to.be.a('string'));",
                "    pm.test('nextStep = email_verification', () => pm.expect(res.nextStep).to.eql('email_verification'));",
                "}"
              ]
            }
          }]
        },

        {
          "name": "02 · Confirmar Email (OTP)",
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [
              { "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" },
              { "key": "Authorization", "value": "Bearer {{accessToken}}" }
            ],
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"email\": \"{{email}}\",\n  \"code\": \"{{otpCode}}\"\n}",
              "options": { "raw": { "language": "json" } }
            },
            "url": { "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/auth/email-verification/confirm", "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"], "path": ["auth", "email-verification", "confirm"] },
            "description": "Valida el código OTP de 6 dígitos.\n\n⚠️ Asegúrate de haber llenado la variable `otpCode` antes de ejecutar."
          },
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "prerequest",
              "script": {
                "exec": [
                  "const code = pm.collectionVariables.get('otpCode');",
                  "if (!code || code.trim() === '') {",
                  "    throw new Error('⚠️  Variable otpCode vacía. Revisa tu correo y pega el código OTP en Variables de la colección.');",
                  "}"
                ]
              }
            },
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "exec": [
                  "if ([200, 201].includes(pm.response.code)) {",
                  "    const res = pm.response.json();",
                  "    console.log('✅ Email verificado — ' + res.user.email);",
                  "    pm.test('Email verificado', () => pm.expect(res.user.emailVerified).to.be.true);",
                  "    postman.setNextRequest('03 · Setup Biométrico');",
                  "} else {",
                  "    console.log('❌ Error: ' + pm.response.text());",
                  "    postman.setNextRequest(null);",
                  "}"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },

        {
          "name": "03 · Setup Biométrico",
          "request": {
            "method": "PATCH",
            "header": [
              { "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" },
              { "key": "Authorization", "value": "Bearer {{accessToken}}" }
            ],
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"enabled\": false\n}",
              "options": { "raw": { "language": "json" } }
            },
            "url": { "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/auth/biometric", "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"], "path": ["auth", "biometric"] },
            "description": "Happy path: salta la biometría (`enabled: false`). El backend igual marca `biometric_prompted = true`.\n\nPara activarla: `{ \"enabled\": true, \"method\": \"face_id\", \"deviceId\": \"device-test-123\" }`"
          },
          "event": [{
            "listen": "test",
            "script": {
              "exec": [
                "if (pm.response.code === 200) {",
                "    const res = pm.response.json();",
                "    console.log('✅ Biometría configurada — enabled: ' + res.enabled);",
                "    pm.test('biometric_prompted marcado', () => pm.response.to.have.status(200));",
                "    postman.setNextRequest('04 · Step → profile_basic');",
                "} else {",
                "    postman.setNextRequest(null);",
                "}"
              ]
            }
          }]
        },

        {
          "name": "04 · Step → profile_basic",
          "request": {
            "method": "PATCH",
            "header": [
              { "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" },
              { "key": "Authorization", "value": "Bearer {{accessToken}}" }
            ],
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"currentStep\": \"profile_basic\",\n  \"resumeSurface\": \"onboarding\"\n}",
              "options": { "raw": { "language": "json" } }
            },
            "url": { "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/auth/onboarding/step", "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"], "path": ["auth", "onboarding", "step"] },
            "description": "Avanza el step a `profile_basic` tras pasar por la pantalla de biometría."
          },
          "event": [{
            "listen": "test",
            "script": {
              "exec": [
                "if (pm.response.code === 200) {",
                "    const res = pm.response.json();",
                "    console.log('✅ Step actualizado → ' + res.currentStep);",
                "    postman.setNextRequest('05 · Guardar Nombre y Alias');",
                "} else {",
                "    postman.setNextRequest(null);",
                "}"
              ]
            }
          }]
        },

        {
          "name": "05 · Guardar Nombre y Alias",
          "request": {
            "method": "PATCH",
            "header": [
              { "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" },
              { "key": "Authorization", "value": "Bearer {{accessToken}}" }
            ],
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"firstName\": \"Test\",\n  \"lastName\": \"Usuario\",\n  \"username\": \"tester\"\n}",
              "options": { "raw": { "language": "json" } }
            },
            "url": { "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/users/profile", "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"], "path": ["users", "profile"] },
            "description": "Persiste nombre, apellido y/o alias. Al menos uno de los tres campos debe tener valor."
          },
          "event": [{
            "listen": "test",
            "script": {
              "exec": [
                "if (pm.response.code === 200) {",
                "    const res = pm.response.json();",
                "    console.log('✅ Nombre guardado — firstName: ' + res.firstName + ' | lastName: ' + res.lastName + ' | username: ' + res.username);",
                "    postman.setNextRequest('06 · Step → welcome');",
                "} else {",
                "    postman.setNextRequest(null);",
                "}"
              ]
            }
          }]
        },

        {
          "name": "06 · Step → welcome",
          "request": {
            "method": "PATCH",
            "header": [
              { "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" },
              { "key": "Authorization", "value": "Bearer {{accessToken}}" }
            ],
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"currentStep\": \"welcome\",\n  \"resumeSurface\": \"onboarding\"\n}",
              "options": { "raw": { "language": "json" } }
            },
            "url": { "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/auth/onboarding/step", "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"], "path": ["auth", "onboarding", "step"] },
            "description": "Avanza a la pantalla Onboarding_Welcome."
          },
          "event": [{
            "listen": "test",
            "script": {
              "exec": [
                "if (pm.response.code === 200) {",
                "    console.log('✅ Step → welcome');",
                "    postman.setNextRequest('07 · Step → document_upload');",
                "} else {",
                "    postman.setNextRequest(null);",
                "}"
              ]
            }
          }]
        },

        {
          "name": "07 · Step → document_upload",
          "request": {
            "method": "PATCH",
            "header": [
              { "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" },
              { "key": "Authorization", "value": "Bearer {{accessToken}}" }
            ],
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"currentStep\": \"document_upload\",\n  \"resumeSurface\": \"onboarding\"\n}",
              "options": { "raw": { "language": "json" } }
            },
            "url": { "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/auth/onboarding/step", "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"], "path": ["auth", "onboarding", "step"] },
            "description": "Usuario toca '¡Comencemos!' en Welcome. Entra al frame de carga de documentos."
          },
          "event": [{
            "listen": "test",
            "script": {
              "exec": [
                "if (pm.response.code === 200) {",
                "    console.log('✅ Step → document_upload');",
                "    postman.setNextRequest('08 · Consultar Estado Onboarding');",
                "} else {",
                "    postman.setNextRequest(null);",
                "}"
              ]
            }
          }]
        },

        {
          "name": "08 · Consultar Estado Onboarding",
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "header": [{ "key": "Authorization", "value": "Bearer {{accessToken}}" }],
            "url": { "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/auth/onboarding", "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"], "path": ["auth", "onboarding"] },
            "description": "Verifica el estado final del onboarding tras recorrer el happy path.\n\nEspera: `onboardingStatus: 'in_progress'`, `currentStep: 'document_upload'`, `biometricPrompted: true`."
          },
          "event": [{
            "listen": "test",
            "script": {
              "exec": [
                "if (pm.response.code === 200) {",
                "    const res = pm.response.json();",
                "    console.log('📋 Estado onboarding:');",
                "    console.log('   status:           ' + res.onboardingStatus);",
                "    console.log('   currentStep:      ' + res.currentStep);",
                "    console.log('   resumeSurface:    ' + res.resumeSurface);",
                "    console.log('   biometricPrompted:' + res.biometricPrompted);",
                "    console.log('   importAttempted:  ' + res.importAttempted);",
                "    pm.test('biometricPrompted = true', () => pm.expect(res.biometricPrompted).to.be.true);",
                "    pm.test('currentStep = document_upload', () => pm.expect(res.currentStep).to.eql('document_upload'));",
                "}"
              ]
            }
          }]
        }

      ]
    },

    {
      "name": "🔐 Autenticación",
      "item": [

        {
          "name": "Login",
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [{ "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" }],
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"email\": \"{{email}}\",\n  \"password\": \"{{password}}\"\n}",
              "options": { "raw": { "language": "json" } }
            },
            "url": { "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/auth/login", "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"], "path": ["auth", "login"] },
            "description": "Login con email y contraseña. Si el usuario tiene `pending_verification`, emite tokens y reenvía el OTP automáticamente."
          },
          "event": [{
            "listen": "test",
            "script": {
              "exec": [
                "if ([200, 201].includes(pm.response.code)) {",
                "    const res = pm.response.json();",
                "    pm.collectionVariables.set('accessToken', res.accessToken);",
                "    pm.collectionVariables.set('refreshToken', res.refreshToken);",
                "    pm.collectionVariables.set('userId', res.user.id);",
                "    console.log('✅ Login OK — emailVerified: ' + res.user.emailVerified);",
                "    if (res.nextStep) console.log('➡️  nextStep: ' + res.nextStep);",
                "}"
              ]
            }
          }]
        },

        {
          "name": "Refresh Token",
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [{ "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" }],
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"refreshToken\": \"{{refreshToken}}\"\n}",
              "options": { "raw": { "language": "json" } }
            },
            "url": { "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/auth/refresh", "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"], "path": ["auth", "refresh"] },
            "description": "Rota el par de tokens. El refresh token anterior queda revocado.\n\nSi se presenta un token ya revocado → backend cierra TODAS las sesiones (replay attack protection)."
          },
          "event": [{
            "listen": "test",
            "script": {
              "exec": [
                "if ([200, 201].includes(pm.response.code)) {",
                "    const res = pm.response.json();",
                "    pm.collectionVariables.set('accessToken', res.accessToken);",
                "    pm.collectionVariables.set('refreshToken', res.refreshToken);",
                "    console.log('✅ Tokens renovados');",
                "}"
              ]
            }
          }]
        },

        {
          "name": "Logout (dispositivo actual)",
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [{ "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" }],
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"refreshToken\": \"{{refreshToken}}\"\n}",
              "options": { "raw": { "language": "json" } }
            },
            "url": { "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/auth/logout", "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"], "path": ["auth", "logout"] },
            "description": "Revoca solo el refresh token del dispositivo actual. Siempre retorna 200."
          },
          "event": [{
            "listen": "test",
            "script": {
              "exec": [
                "if ([200, 201].includes(pm.response.code)) {",
                "    pm.collectionVariables.set('accessToken', '');",
                "    pm.collectionVariables.set('refreshToken', '');",
                "    console.log('✅ Logout OK — tokens limpiados');",
                "}"
              ]
            }
          }]
        },

        {
          "name": "Logout (todos los dispositivos)",
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [{ "key": "Authorization", "value": "Bearer {{accessToken}}" }],
            "url": { "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/auth/logout-all", "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"], "path": ["auth", "logout-all"] },
            "description": "Revoca TODOS los refresh tokens activos del usuario. Requiere access token válido.\n\nÚtil cuando el usuario cree que su cuenta fue comprometida."
          },
          "event": [{
            "listen": "test",
            "script": {
              "exec": [
                "if ([200, 201].includes(pm.response.code)) {",
                "    pm.collectionVariables.set('accessToken', '');",
                "    pm.collectionVariables.set('refreshToken', '');",
                "    console.log('✅ Todas las sesiones cerradas');",
                "}"
              ]
            }
          }]
        }

      ]
    },

    {
      "name": "📧 Verificación de Email",
      "item": [

        {
          "name": "Solicitar OTP",
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [
              { "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" },
              { "key": "Authorization", "value": "Bearer {{accessToken}}" }
            ],
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"email\": \"{{email}}\"\n}",
              "options": { "raw": { "language": "json" } }
            },
            "url": { "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/auth/email-verification/request", "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"], "path": ["auth", "email-verification", "request"] },
            "description": "Genera y envía un nuevo código OTP. Invalida el código previo. Rate limit: 3/hora."
          }
        },

        {
          "name": "Confirmar OTP",
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [
              { "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" },
              { "key": "Authorization", "value": "Bearer {{accessToken}}" }
            ],
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"email\": \"{{email}}\",\n  \"code\": \"{{otpCode}}\"\n}",
              "options": { "raw": { "language": "json" } }
            },
            "url": { "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/auth/email-verification/confirm", "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"], "path": ["auth", "email-verification", "confirm"] },
            "description": "Valida el OTP. Máximo 5 intentos fallidos antes de invalidar el código.\n\nLlena la variable `otpCode` antes de ejecutar."
          },
          "event": [{
            "listen": "prerequest",
            "script": {
              "exec": [
                "const code = pm.collectionVariables.get('otpCode');",
                "if (!code || code.trim() === '') {",
                "    throw new Error('⚠️  Variable otpCode vacía. Revisa tu correo y pega el código.');",
                "}"
              ]
            }
          }]
        },

        {
          "name": "Reenviar OTP",
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [
              { "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" },
              { "key": "Authorization", "value": "Bearer {{accessToken}}" }
            ],
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"email\": \"{{email}}\"\n}",
              "options": { "raw": { "language": "json" } }
            },
            "url": { "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/auth/email-verification/resend", "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"], "path": ["auth", "email-verification", "resend"] },
            "description": "Reenvía el OTP e invalida el anterior. Rate limit: 3/hora."
          }
        }

      ]
    },

    {
      "name": "🔑 Contraseña",
      "item": [

        {
          "name": "Forgot Password — Solicitar OTP",
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [{ "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" }],
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"email\": \"{{email}}\"\n}",
              "options": { "raw": { "language": "json" } }
            },
            "url": { "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/auth/forgot-password", "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"], "path": ["auth", "forgot-password"] },
            "description": "Paso 1 — Envía un código OTP de 6 dígitos al correo del usuario.\n\nSiempre retorna el mismo mensaje genérico (no revela si el email existe).\n\n**Próximo paso:** revisa el correo, copia el código de 6 dígitos y pégalo en la variable `resetOtpCode`. Luego ejecuta 'Reset Password — Verificar OTP'.\n\n**Expiración:** 15 minutos. **Intentos máximos:** 5."
          }
        },

        {
          "name": "Reset Password — Verificar OTP",
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [{ "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" }],
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"email\": \"{{email}}\",\n  \"code\": \"{{resetOtpCode}}\",\n  \"newPassword\": \"NuevaPass@456\"\n}",
              "options": { "raw": { "language": "json" } }
            },
            "url": { "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/auth/reset-password", "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"], "path": ["auth", "reset-password"] },
            "description": "Paso 2 — Verifica el código OTP y actualiza la contraseña.\n\nRevoca todas las sesiones activas al completar.\n\n**Antes de ejecutar:** llena `resetOtpCode` con el código de 6 dígitos recibido por email.\n\n**Errores posibles:**\n- Código incorrecto: responde con intentos restantes\n- 5 intentos fallidos: solicitar nuevo código con 'Forgot Password'"
          }
        },

        {
          "name": "Cambiar Contraseña",
          "request": {
            "method": "PATCH",
            "header": [
              { "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" },
              { "key": "Authorization", "value": "Bearer {{accessToken}}" }
            ],
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"currentPassword\": \"{{password}}\",\n  \"newPassword\": \"NuevaPass@456\"\n}",
              "options": { "raw": { "language": "json" } }
            },
            "url": { "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/users/me/password", "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"], "path": ["users", "me", "password"] },
            "description": "Cambia la contraseña desde el perfil. Requiere la contraseña actual. Revoca todas las sesiones activas al completar."
          }
        }

      ]
    },

    {
      "name": "📋 Onboarding",
      "item": [

        {
          "name": "GET Estado",
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "header": [{ "key": "Authorization", "value": "Bearer {{accessToken}}" }],
            "url": { "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/auth/onboarding", "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"], "path": ["auth", "onboarding"] },
            "description": "Retorna el estado completo del onboarding. La app lo consulta al abrirse para decidir la pantalla inicial.\n\n**Lógica de navegación:**\n- `resume_surface = 'home'` → Home\n- `resume_surface = 'onboarding'` → pantalla correspondiente a `current_step`\n- `resume_surface = null` → primera apertura: email_verification\n- `onboarding_status = 'completed'` → Home"
          },
          "event": [{
            "listen": "test",
            "script": {
              "exec": [
                "if (pm.response.code === 200) {",
                "    const res = pm.response.json();",
                "    console.log('📋 Estado onboarding:');",
                "    console.log('   status:        ' + res.onboardingStatus);",
                "    console.log('   currentStep:   ' + res.currentStep);",
                "    console.log('   resumeSurface: ' + res.resumeSurface);",
                "}"
              ]
            }
          }]
        },

        {
          "name": "Step → document_processing (enviar docs)",
          "request": {
            "method": "PATCH",
            "header": [
              { "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" },
              { "key": "Authorization", "value": "Bearer {{accessToken}}" }
            ],
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"currentStep\": \"document_processing\",\n  \"resumeSurface\": \"onboarding\",\n  \"importAttempted\": true\n}",
              "options": { "raw": { "language": "json" } }
            },
            "url": { "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/auth/onboarding/step", "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"], "path": ["auth", "onboarding", "step"] },
            "description": "Usuario toca 'Continuemos' tras subir documentos. Marca `importAttempted = true`."
          }
        },

        {
          "name": "Salir desde Welcome → Home",
          "request": {
            "method": "PATCH",
            "header": [
              { "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" },
              { "key": "Authorization", "value": "Bearer {{accessToken}}" }
            ],
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"currentStep\": \"document_upload\",\n  \"resumeSurface\": \"home\",\n  \"resumeContext\": { \"pendingStep\": \"document_upload\" }\n}",
              "options": { "raw": { "language": "json" } }
            },
            "url": { "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/auth/onboarding/step", "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"], "path": ["auth", "onboarding", "step"] },
            "description": "Flujo B: usuario toca 'Continuar más tarde' desde Welcome o Carga de docs. Sale sin haber procesado nada."
          }
        },

        {
          "name": "Salir desde Analizando → Home",
          "request": {
            "method": "PATCH",
            "header": [
              { "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" },
              { "key": "Authorization", "value": "Bearer {{accessToken}}" }
            ],
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"currentStep\": \"document_processing\",\n  \"resumeSurface\": \"home\",\n  \"resumeContext\": { \"jobId\": \"job-uuid-aqui\" }\n}",
              "options": { "raw": { "language": "json" } }
            },
            "url": { "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/auth/onboarding/step", "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"], "path": ["auth", "onboarding", "step"] },
            "description": "Flujo C: usuario sale mientras el análisis sigue en curso. El análisis continúa en el servidor. Llenar `jobId` con el ID del job de análisis."
          }
        }

      ]
    },

    {
      "name": "👤 Perfil & Biométrico",
      "item": [

        {
          "name": "GET Perfil",
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "header": [{ "key": "Authorization", "value": "Bearer {{accessToken}}" }],
            "url": { "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/users/me", "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"], "path": ["users", "me"] },
            "description": "Retorna el perfil público del usuario autenticado."
          }
        },

        {
          "name": "PATCH Nombre y Alias (onboarding)",
          "request": {
            "method": "PATCH",
            "header": [
              { "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" },
              { "key": "Authorization", "value": "Bearer {{accessToken}}" }
            ],
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"firstName\": \"Ana\",\n  \"lastName\": \"Pérez\",\n  \"username\": \"Ani\"\n}",
              "options": { "raw": { "language": "json" } }
            },
            "url": { "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/users/profile", "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"], "path": ["users", "profile"] },
            "description": "Paso '¿Cómo quieres que te llamemos?' del onboarding.\n\nEnvía firstName, lastName y/o username por separado. Al menos uno debe tener valor.\n\nValidación cruzada: si todos están vacíos → 400."
          }
        },

        {
          "name": "PATCH Perfil general",
          "request": {
            "method": "PATCH",
            "header": [
              { "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" },
              { "key": "Authorization", "value": "Bearer {{accessToken}}" }
            ],
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"firstName\": \"Ana\",\n  \"lastName\": \"Pérez\",\n  \"username\": \"aniux\",\n  \"avatarUrl\": \"https://cdn.example.com/avatar.jpg\"\n}",
              "options": { "raw": { "language": "json" } }
            },
            "url": { "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/users/me", "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"], "path": ["users", "me"] },
            "description": "Actualiza perfil general (firstName, lastName, username, avatarUrl). Todos los campos son opcionales. El email no es modificable."
          }
        },

        {
          "name": "PATCH Biométrico — Activar (Face ID)",
          "request": {
            "method": "PATCH",
            "header": [
              { "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" },
              { "key": "Authorization", "value": "Bearer {{accessToken}}" }
            ],
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"enabled\": true,\n  \"method\": \"face_id\",\n  \"deviceId\": \"device-test-001\"\n}",
              "options": { "raw": { "language": "json" } }
            },
            "url": { "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/auth/biometric", "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"], "path": ["auth", "biometric"] },
            "description": "Activa autenticación biométrica. Métodos válidos: `face_id`, `fingerprint`, `device_pin`.\n\nSiempre marca `biometric_prompted = true` en onboarding."
          }
        },

        {
          "name": "PATCH Biométrico — Saltar",
          "request": {
            "method": "PATCH",
            "header": [
              { "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" },
              { "key": "Authorization", "value": "Bearer {{accessToken}}" }
            ],
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"enabled\": false\n}",
              "options": { "raw": { "language": "json" } }
            },
            "url": { "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/auth/biometric", "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"], "path": ["auth", "biometric"] },
            "description": "Usuario salta la biometría. Limpia `method` y `deviceId`. Igualmente marca `biometric_prompted = true`."
          }
        }

      ]
    },

    {
      "name": "💳 Suscripciones",
      "description": "Gestión de planes y pagos con Flow.cl.\n\n**Flujo de pago:**\n1. `GET /subscriptions/plans` → elige un plan y copia su `id` en la variable `planId`.\n2. `POST /subscriptions/checkout` → abre la `paymentUrl` en el navegador y completa el pago en Flow.\n3. Flow llama automáticamente al webhook del backend → suscripción activada.\n4. `GET /subscriptions/me` → confirma que el `status` pasó a `active`.\n\n**Precios actuales:** Pro Mensual 5.000 CLP / Pro Anual 50.000 CLP.",
      "item": [

        {
          "name": "GET Planes disponibles",
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "header": [],
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/subscriptions/plans",
              "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"],
              "path": ["subscriptions", "plans"]
            },
            "description": "Público — no requiere autenticación.\n\nRetorna todos los planes activos. Copia el `id` del plan deseado en la variable `planId` antes de ejecutar el checkout.\n\nPlanes disponibles:\n- `pro_monthly` — 5.000 CLP/mes\n- `pro_annual` — 50.000 CLP/año (ahorra 10.000 CLP)"
          },
          "event": [{
            "listen": "test",
            "script": {
              "exec": [
                "if (pm.response.code === 200) {",
                "    const plans = pm.response.json();",
                "    const monthly = plans.find(p => p.slug === 'pro_monthly');",
                "    if (monthly) {",
                "        pm.collectionVariables.set('planId', monthly.id);",
                "        console.log('✅ planId (pro_monthly) guardado: ' + monthly.id);",
                "    }",
                "    console.log('Planes disponibles: ' + plans.map(p => p.slug + ' — ' + p.price + ' ' + p.currency).join(' | '));",
                "}"
              ]
            }
          }]
        },

        {
          "name": "GET Mi suscripción",
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "header": [
              { "key": "Authorization", "value": "Bearer {{accessToken}}" }
            ],
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/subscriptions/me",
              "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"],
              "path": ["subscriptions", "me"]
            },
            "description": "Retorna la suscripción activa del usuario autenticado.\n\nDevuelve `null` si el usuario no tiene suscripción (está en período de prueba o nunca pagó).\n\nValores de `status`: `trialing` · `active` · `past_due` · `cancelled` · `expired`"
          }
        },

        {
          "name": "POST Checkout (iniciar pago)",
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [
              { "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" },
              { "key": "Authorization", "value": "Bearer {{accessToken}}" }
            ],
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"planId\": \"{{planId}}\"\n}",
              "options": { "raw": { "language": "json" } }
            },
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/subscriptions/checkout",
              "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"],
              "path": ["subscriptions", "checkout"]
            },
            "description": "Inicia el proceso de pago en Flow.\n\nRetorna `{ paymentUrl }` — abrir esta URL en el navegador para completar el pago.\n\nTras el pago exitoso, Flow llama al webhook del backend y activa la suscripción automáticamente.\n\n**Requisito:** la variable `planId` debe estar cargada (ejecutar primero 'GET Planes disponibles')."
          },
          "event": [{
            "listen": "test",
            "script": {
              "exec": [
                "if (pm.response.code === 201) {",
                "    const res = pm.response.json();",
                "    console.log('✅ Checkout iniciado — abre esta URL para pagar: ' + res.paymentUrl);",
                "} else {",
                "    console.log('❌ Error checkout: ' + pm.response.text());",
                "}"
              ]
            }
          }]
        }

      ]
    }

  ]
}
